  "prefLabel": "Rev 401.01 Accident, mistake, or misfortune",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 401.01 “Accident, mistake, or misfortune” means something outside a person’s control, or something which a reasonably prudent person would not be expected to guard against or provide for.\n\nSource. #2080, eff 7-5-82; ss by #2272, eff 1-11-83; ss by #2821, eff 8-17-84; ss by #4511, eff 10-26-88; ss by #5911, eff 10-14-94; ss by #7410, eff 11-23-00; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 400) #9309, eff 10-30-08; ss by #12027, eff 10-28-16",
